  "_doc": "Sound cues added by motion presets. 'cue' is a cue name in the scene's sound pack; 'at' is when it plays, as a fraction of the motion's duration (0 = start); 'gain' (default 1) lifts quiet cues like swipe so they read under motion. Motions not listed here are silent (camera moves, float, slow-turn).",
